TruthfulQA adaptation

Source: https://github.com/sylinrl/TruthfulQA
Revision: d71c110897f5d31c5d7f309e7bc316c152f6f031
Authors: Stephanie Lin, Jacob Hilton, Owain Evans
Paper: TruthfulQA: Measuring How Models Mimic Human Falsehoods (2022)
License: Apache License 2.0 (included as LICENSE)

OSMSI changes: category-stratified subset of 256 questions; paired best correct
and best incorrect answers; balanced answer order; self-reported confidence
format. This is not the official MC1 or MC2 metric.

The three synthetic diagnostic suites and generation code are OSMSI contributions,
also licensed under Apache License 2.0.
